{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25117","headline":"闻韦驸马使君迁拜台州 · 长孙佐辅","name":"闻韦驸马使君迁拜台州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溟藩轸帝忧，见说初鸣驺。\n德胜祸先戢，情闲思自流。\n蚕殷桑柘空，廪实雀鼠稠。\n谏虎昔赐骏，安人将问牛。\n曾陪後乘光，共逐平津游。\n旌斾拥追赏，歌钟催献酬。\n音徽一寂寥，贵贱双沈浮。\n北郭乏中崖，东方称上头。\n跻山望百城，目尽增遐愁。\n海逼日月近，天高星汉秋。\n无阶异渐鸿，有志慙驯鸥。\n终期促孤櫂，暂访天台幽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙佐辅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}